## Personal AI Runtime v2

For a non-trivial task, first use the project-aware Runtime context command:

`python "$env:USERPROFILE\.ai-workspace\runtime\aiw.py" context "<current task>"`

- Use only the selected project Memory Pack and the small set of routed active skills.
- Do not perform a full global-skill scan or load unrelated project Memory.
- Load L3 historical evidence only when the user explicitly asks about prior work, history, or an earlier fix.
- Private memory, raw sessions, credentials, cookies, and tokens remain outside Git repositories.
